5. u4#-ba {d}asznan nam-gir15#-ra#?-na x mi-ni-in-us2-e!? 
#tr.en: At that time Ezina (the grain goddess) was ... her pride/native status(?) 
6. [{d}]asznan# {d#}lahar-ra mu-na-ni-ib-gi4#-gi4# 
